      "notes": "The paper describes 27 compression points, while Table S1 prints 28 rows because measurement P8 is split into P8a and P8b; no row is discarded. Parentheses are transcribed as absolute uncertainties in the last digits. The source calls these unit-cell volumes but labels and reports them in A^3/atom. Temperature 300 K follows the EOS figures."
